+/** Iterate over the source indices of an ALU instruction.
+ *
+ * Keep the source count in a local variable.  In particular, this avoids
+ * repeated loads when calls in the loop body may alias the instruction and
+ * prevent the compiler from hoisting the lookup on its own.
